<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="1">

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 2/8" Page="1" Title=""/>
      <Text>Int. In front of Fireplace - Dusk</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Joni looks pensive into the camera.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Joni</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Good Evening, I’m Joni Ernst.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>As a mother, a soldier, and as Mitch McConnell said to me earlier today “The hot new piece of Republican ass” I am proud to speak with you tonight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>A few moments ago, we heard the president lay out his vision for the future. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Joni grimaces.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Joni (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Now, even if we may not always agree, we can on one thing and that is: Obama’s a dummy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Joni laughs to herself.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Joni (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(sotto)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Ernst slam!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>She quickly regains her stately composure.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>JonI (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But I digress.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The new Republican congress knows that you, the voters have given us a mandate.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You wanted an overwhelmingly white, male constituency that preferred </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold">not</Text>
      <Text> to pay me an equal wage.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>And we have heard your message. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You explicitly said Orrin Hatch’s livelihood is worth more than my own.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You cried out:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Joni cups her hands around her mouth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>JONI (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(fake yelling)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>“John Boehner needs nearly 25% more than Joni Ernst because of his booze and fake tanning addiction!”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Joni drops her hands in defeat. Laughing a little as they come to a rest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>JONI (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>And we heard you loud and clear.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition">
      <Text>Cut to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="6/8" Page="2" Title=""/>
      <Text>INT. The NoHo Rag Studios</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec and Chip sit at the desk. Chip sits with a puzzled look. Alec shakes his head towards the camera in disappointment.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>It’s 2015 for crying out loud! How can opposition to equal pay even be televised! She’s a puppet! Joni, you’re a fucking puppet!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec turns to Chip.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Chip</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>That man had a funny voice!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(grumbles)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You’ve got a funny voice, and bricks for brains.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>CHIP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>He was dressed well, though.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec wipes his face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>That was a woman, Chip.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>CHIP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>A woman? What is this a USO show?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec turns to the camera and waves.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Goodnight everyone!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

